---LINES
var     = ipv   -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
alt1    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "YES"
alt2    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipm   -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = gv - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = ga - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = gm - - - - " MSE "

---SCREEN                                                          
=LINLIB generic keyboard command/actions
                                                                              
+."common"..........            .MSE.   .mse..... -------select menu item:
+get help:          .:HE...                       .:SP... or .:NL...
+exit/close page:   .:EX...                               
+refresh page:      .:RE...     .ALT.   .alt2.    --------alter or toggle:
+cancel:            .:CA...                       .:SP... - forward
+next line:         .:TA...                       .:DE... - backward
+                               
+."page navigation".            .VAR.   .var..... --------switch to edit: 
+jump to 1st line:  .:KH...                       .:SP... - keep content
+     - last line:  .:KE...                       .:DE... - clear field
+next page/part:    .:PU...                                                     
+prev page/part:    .:PD...     ."in edit mode"........          --with-prefix-
+                               erase left from cursor:  .:DE...              
+."special".........                erase below cursor:  .:KD...  .:PR .:DE...
+commit,                               erase up to end:           .:PR .:SP...
+  complete editing,            jump to 1st symbol:      .:KH...  .:PR .:AL...
+    next line:     .:NL...       jump to end of text:   .:KE...  .:PR .:AR...
+option prefix:     .:PR...     toggle Ins/Ovr mode:     .:KI...  .:PR .:PR... 
+                               
=LINLIB (c) 1986-1990,2020 vsv&team
---END                          
